      "text": "Passively grants the following benefits while a Hand Cannon is readied:\n• 20 Airborne Effectiveness\n• 6.25% increased Sprint Speed\n• 33% increased Slide Distance\n\nReadying a Hand Cannon grants 'Illegally Modded Holster' for 6 seconds (for the PVE-only benefits of the perk, consider this the 0th Stack).\n\n'Illegally Modded Holster' grants the following benefits to Hand Cannons:\n• 100 Ready Speed Handling\n• 0.6x Ready Animation Duration Multiplier\n• 30% decreased Accuracy Cone Size\n• PVE ONLY: Direct Hits grant a Stack of 'Illegally Modded Holster'. Maximum of 10 Stacks.\n\n'Illegally Modded Holster' grants 45% increased Direct Impact damage per Stack, maxing out at 450%. Boss-Tier Enemies take 33% decreased damage from Lucky Pants shots.\n\n• <purple Uncivil Discourse /> only recieves 30% increased damage per stack.\n• <yellow Sturm />'s Overcharged Rounds only receive 11% increased damage per Stack (110%). \n• <yellow Hawkmoon />'s Paracausal Shot receives 5% increased damage per stack upon being fired (50%). \n• <yellow Malfeasance />'s Explosive Shadow is unaffected by the buff.\n\n\nWhile at 'Illegally Modded Holster x7' or higher:\nSwapping to a non-Hand Cannon weapon or the buff expiring grants you the 'Out of Luck' debuff. 'Out of Luck' prevents you from reacquiring 'Illegally Modded Holster' for 10 seconds.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-12T08:16:49.773Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  }
}

