      "text": "Melee/Glaive Melee Kills grant a stack of 'Warlord's Sigil'. Maximum of 10 stacks. Finishers grant 3 stacks (as soon as their animation starts). \n\nWarlord's Sigil stacks decay one at a time every 4.75 seconds.\n\nWarlord's Sigil grants the following Melee Damage increases at 1|2|3|...|10 stacks:\n67.5% | 122% | 166% | 202% | 228% | 249% | 265% | 278% | 289% | 300% Additional Base Melee Damage.\n\n\nReaching or refreshing the duration of the 10th stack grants 1 Melee Ability Charge and 'Warlord's Fury Ready' for 8 seconds. The 10th stack's duration cannot be refreshed by Finishers.\n\nUsing any Melee while Warlord's Fury Ready is active will grant 'Warlord's Fury' for 10 seconds, granting the following benefits:\n• 400% Additional Base Melee Damage\n• 0.8x Melee animation duration\n• 38.4x Melee ability regeneration speed\n\nWarlord's Sigil's stack count is reset to 0 once Warlord's Fury ends. While Warlord's Fury is active, gaining stacks of Warlord's Sigil is not possible. \n\nNot triggering Warlord's Fury will return the buff to Warlord's Sigil x10.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-12T20:28:04.276Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  }
}

